            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Connect Yandex from Settings</h2>
<p>Open Settings → App → Yandex Connector to connect the MCP Store and access your service tokens. The default S3 source works without a GitHub token. Check the available version to install, update or repair the connector. FullHouse recognizes an identical installed copy.</p>
<h2>Import all missing skills from a GitHub collection</h2>
<p>Paste a repository URL and choose Fetch All New Skills. FullHouse identifies each skill by the name in its SKILL.md, even when the folder has a different name. Installed and queued skills are skipped. Review the files for each new skill before applying.</p>
<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Manage several skills at once</strong> — In the Skills library, use Command-click to select individual skills or Shift-click to select a range. Choose their target tools together or queue removal for the selected skills.</li>
</ul>
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Review a Doctor repair in Settings</strong> — Open a Doctor finding to investigate it and review the proposed file changes or command in Settings. Apply the repair after you have checked the proposal.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
